{"id":"prepositions-0109","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 109","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They arrived ___ Rome at dawn.","hint":"arrive ___ (place), ___ (city)","explanation":"arrive IN towns, cities and countries; AT for buildings/points."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I strongly disapprove ___ smoking indoors.","hint":"disapprove ___ sth","explanation":"disapprove OF something (opposite: approve of)."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The lorry crashed ___ the back of the bus.","hint":"crash ___ sth","explanation":"crash INTO something solid (hit it)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":["in","on","at","by"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film is based ___ a true story.","hint":"based ___","explanation":"\u0027Based on\u0027 = developed from."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They\u0027re ashamed ___ their behaviour at the match.","hint":"ashamed ___ sth","explanation":"ashamed OF something/doing something."},{"answer":"about","accept":["of"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Have you heard ___ the artist who paints with coffee?","hint":"hear ___ (be told)","explanation":"hear ABOUT = be told about; hear OF = know of the existence; hear FROM = receive news from."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We\u0027re hoping ___ the best results this season.","hint":"hope ___ sth (want)","explanation":"hope FOR something = want and expect it."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."}]}